Write exactly 2 fill(s), one per numbered [[N]] blank. Each fill must realize its matching instruction and stay coherent with the surrounding skeleton and the other fills: subject, setting, lighting, era, and mood must agree.
- LENGTH: aim for no more than 30 words per fill. Prefer important visual detail over padding.
